      {
        "name": "Organism",
        "value": "Homo sapiens"
      },
      {
        "name": "Description",
        "value": "Objective: Analyze expression patterns of genes located at linkage region of SPOAN syndrome (11q12-13), in order to identify genes differentially expressed in samples of SPOAN individuals compared to healthy controls. Fibroblast samples of 8 samples where analyzed: 4 SPOAN affected patients and 4 healthy controls. There are no replicates and there are not affected and control from the same patient."
      }
    ],
