              "value": "normalization data transformation protocol"
            },
            {
              "name": "Description",
              "value": "The data were analyzed with Affymetrix Expression Console using Sketch-Quantile as normalization method. Analysis was performed using rma-gene-default as parameter for affymetrix-algorithm-param-apt-opt-analysis-name. #%affymetrix-algorithm-param-apt-opt-analysis-spec was specified as rma-bg,quant-norm.sketch=-1.bioc=true.lowprecision=false.usepm=true.subsetmd5=5d3721419adb28afd03b764858482c6b,pm-only,med-polish.expon=false.attenuate=true.l=0.005.h=-1,expr.genotype=false.strand=false. ID_REF =  VALUE = Affymetrix signal intensity after median polishment (log2 scaled)."
            }
          ],
